WEBVTT

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:51.550
"Sasaki and Miyano"

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:06.540
"I Want to Take Care of You, Senpai."

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.750
Mya-chan, you don't fight fair.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.660
Wh-What do you mean?

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.490
That startled me.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:21.110
Sorry, Mya-chan.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:22.740
This came off.

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.620
Oh, thanks.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:28.080
When did it fall off?

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.290
Huh? It's locked.

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:34.290
What? It is? Why?

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:35.750
Yeah...

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:39.840
Hey, about what I said.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:43.010
I was half-joking,
so don't worry about it.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:45.430
Joking? But...

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:15.710
Oh, Sasaki-senpai.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:18.840
Kuresawa. You're cross-dressing, too?

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:22.090
I'm backup, so it's partly just for fun.

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:23.260
Oh.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:24.430
See ya.

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:30.100
Guess what. Tashiro mistook me again--

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.100
Miyano, what's up?

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:34.770
It's nothing.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.150
What just happened?

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:00.920
I solved it!

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:04.090
Okay. Then this is an easy one.

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:06.970
What was that about?

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:11.600
Miyano, you do this one.
Difficulty should be normal.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:13.020
Sure.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.850
No, he probably...

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.440
Would you drop out?

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:22.610
I bet that was...

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:26.860
Huh? Is it too hard?

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:29.570
No. I can do it...

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:32.830
...wanting to do things for them.

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:36.160
In that moment,

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:37.790
I...

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:41.590
...wanted to hug him.

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:46.510
It feels... like I could burst...

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:54.180
Is this what it's like to like someone?

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:59.190
If this means I like him the
same way and we date and ki--

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:00.900
Whoa, hold my horses!

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:02.690
What am I thinking?

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.070
I'm moving too fast!

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:06.740
Kiss him? We haven't even had a date!

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:12.660
What's wrong with my brain?

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:16.290
Miyano's acting kinda weird today, right?
Did something happen?

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:17.710
Hmm.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:21.040
During the fitting...
I'll have to ask later.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:22.130
Did ya say something?

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.170
Nope. Nothing.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:28.430
Miyano, come to the bookstore with me.
I wanna get my girlfriend a present.

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:30.720
Oh, uh, sure.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:37.890
It might be a good thing I wasn't able
to say I liked him in that moment.

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:40.560
I did want to hug him, but...

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:43.060
I've never kissed anyone.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:48.490
If it turned out I was wrong,
wouldn't that hurt him?

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:50.360
I don't wanna hurt him.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.370
I can't just do that in the moment.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.240
You okay?

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:55.330
Oh, uh, yeah.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:04.500
I'll think more about whether
I like him the way he likes me.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.380
"Stuff It All In by Nightfall!"

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.380
"cross-dressing x devil x pastor/priest
x age gap x and more!"

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:12.180
But this is a whole other
issue from that one.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:17.430
They can't even fit all the tropes
in the blurb. Looks kinda fun.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:22.400
Even though I want to listen to Senpai,

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:25.860
it doesn't feel right
to drop out of the competition.

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:29.070
What's this guilty feeling?

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:30.700
What's wrong. Got a cavity?

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:32.570
No.

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:35.580
I just keep making him wait.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:39.200
I'm too wishy washy with things.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:41.790
About answering him, too...

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:45.960
If it's not a cavity, then what? You've
been touching your cheek all day.

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.340
Uh...

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:52.930
If your girlfriend told you to quit
right now, what would you do?

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.390
Quit looking for BL?

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:56.550
I think she'd be sad if I did.

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:58.140
Not this.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:02.440
Um, something else...
Like your club activities?

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:06.730
I'd qui--I mean, it would
depend on the reason.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:09.150
Were you just about to say you'd quit?

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.110
"I Never Imagined I'd Be
My Childhood Friend's Manager"

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:14.490
I thought you'd decisively say you'd quit.

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:18.660
If quitting would be
of benefit for her, sure.

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:23.540
If she wasn't serious and I actually quit,
that'd make her regretful.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:29.590
Oh, hey, does this have gorgeous guys?
That's what I need to know.

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:30.420
It does.

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:32.630
The manager's sub-plot features heavily,

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:34.680
and his love interest is also gorgeous.

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.050
Oh, two for one.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.940
That'd make her regretful.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:51.650
If I asked you not to compete...

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:55.570
My hesitation isn't just
because he asked me.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:59.660
Senpai also values what I like...

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:03.710
I think BL is what
made this story possible.

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:08.840
I probably would have only
deflected in that situation.

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:12.260
So that I don't just admire him...

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:15.130
So that I can stand tall around him...

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:19.220
I...

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:24.730
You got a cold?

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:25.810
I might...

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:27.100
Go to bed early.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:28.860
Sure, Mommy Hirano.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.900
Don't give me that lip.

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:31.940
Hirano!

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:32.900
--Gym?
--Sasaki-senpai.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:34.490
--Yeah, next.
--Sasaki-senpai.

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:35.990
--Basketball.
--I'll catch up, Kuresawa.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:36.950
--Good luck.
--'Kay.

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.070
Thanks!

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:41.200
Mya-chan?

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:45.580
Um, I want to talk to you about something.

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:46.670
What's up?

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:51.130
Uh, it's about the
cross-dressing competition...

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:53.880
Oh... okay.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:56.260
About dropping out...

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:01.350
I... can't do that.

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:07.980
Okay.

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:12.480
To say I want to compete
is slightly misleading, but...

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:15.650
Your face might change completely.

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:20.410
But because you told me
you like more than my face, I...

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:21.660
Sasaki, I--

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:23.950
Crap, I almost interrupted them.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:27.910
And also, um, because
I didn't like my face,

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:31.750
I thought it would bother me
even more if I wore girl clothes,

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:34.710
so I always hated the idea, but...

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:40.720
But my classmates are helping me
with stuff, like lines to say...

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:45.100
Oh, and Hanzawa-senpai has
helped so much with the outfit...

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:50.810
And in high school, people aren't
teasing me as much, so...

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:54.940
I made the decision to compete myself.

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:58.490
So I want to follow through with it.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:01.360
I'm the reason?

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:05.830
Okay. Good luck.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:14.540
I'm happy you told me how you feel.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.050
I'll be rooting for you.

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:20.590
Thanks!

00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:26.850
Does your outfit show a lot of skin,
or is it the one I saw?

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:31.730
It's kind of a student theme,
so I don't think it'll really show skin.

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:33.900
That's what the Chairman selected for me.

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:37.030
So that's why he was there.

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:38.360
Well, time to head back.

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:39.900
Yeah, see ya.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.570
Oh.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:44.070
Um, Senpai.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:46.490
Will you have free time
during the festival?

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:50.910
I'm not sure about my schedule.
I should know later.

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:54.790
If possible, would you like
to see the festival together?

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:57.130
Huh? Oh, yeah. Are you sure?

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:59.630
Yes! Okay then.

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:08.520
Oh.

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:10.310
Were you listening?

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:12.560
Arranging a date?

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:15.400
We're not going out,
but I guess it's a date.

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:17.150
What?

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:21.240
He must have thought about that
so much since yesterday...

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:29.660
Didn't you confess before summer?

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:31.120
He hasn't answered yet.

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:32.790
Still?!

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:36.790
If he's gonna take so long,
he should just say no for now.

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:39.800
I can wait.

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:42.630
If he'll be interested in me,

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:44.220
I can keep on waiting.

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:51.310
It's kinda freaky when
you say stuff like that.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:52.520
Huh?

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:05.240
Hey, that college seminar thing today...

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:06.280
Yeah?

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:07.910
Can I skip it?

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:08.910
Idiot.

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:24.800
"Stuffy"

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:26.340
Go see the nurse!

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:27.340
Don't spread it.

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:31.680
I just studied too much. I'm not sick.

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.810
Go to the nurse!

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:39.150
If you have to stay home during
the festival, you'll miss your date.

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:42.780
There are only little
things left. Go home.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:44.860
Hmm.

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:47.950
Excuse me, I'm going to the nurse.

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:58.420
"A Girls' School for a Day"

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.590
This is for Mya-chan's competition.

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:04.380
I hope nothing weird happens.

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:12.180
Even if something does happen,
his classmates will probably help him.

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:15.680
And Hanzawa is helping him.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:20.060
But him getting up
in front of other guys...

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:22.570
Even in guys' clothes, I wouldn't like it.

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:23.150
"Nurse's Office"

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:26.280
"Nurse's Office"

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:26.280
And here I said I'd root for him.

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:28.700
"Nurse's Office"

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:28.700
I'm making things complicated.

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.620
"Currently Out.
Will Return Soon."

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:31.740
"Currently Out.
Will Return Soon."
Oh.

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:33.790
So nobody's here.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.750
Now what?

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:37.460
--Is it okay to wait inside?

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:39.790
--Sasaki-senpai?
--Is it okay to wait inside?

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.210
Mya-chan?

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:43.840
Hey.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:52.390
It says, "Will return soon,"
so why don't we go inside for now?

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:53.430
Yeah.

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:55.220
Do you feel sick?

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:56.810
I keep sneezing.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.730
I wonder where the forms are.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:06.230
Mya-chan, you're hurt? Are you okay?

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:13.070
Well... I'm bad at cooking,
so I burned myself a little in class.

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:13.910
What?

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:19.000
It doesn't hurt that much, but the
teacher made me go to the nurse.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:22.250
Oh. Well, that's good.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.500
I'll go ahead and fill out the forms.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.960
You sit on the sofa.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.130
Okay.

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:30.050
He's taking care of everything.

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:38.390
Ugh, I think my nose is red now.

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:41.060
Senpai, are you okay?

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:42.440
Hold o--

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:45.480
His sneeze is cute.

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:46.900
Would you like a tissue?

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:48.070
Yeah.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:51.650
I'm so lame.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:53.820
Are you okay? Do you have a cold?

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:56.990
Um, I feel a little spacey...

00:15:56.990 --> 00:15:59.910
Let's take your temperature.
Are you nauseous?

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:02.830
No, just a little fatigued.

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:05.420
Here, use this.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:12.930
Senpai?! Are you okay?

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:15.010
He's so cute...

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:16.850
You should lie down.

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:19.140
Are you sure this is okay?

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:22.940
We aren't goofing around or messing
with the supplies, so it's fine.

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:24.020
Okay.

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:25.770
Are you cold?

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:27.730
Yeah, a little.

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:29.780
Hold on a moment.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:32.860
There should be a blanket...

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:34.950
It's like he's searching a house.

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:39.660
It's not like Mya-chan's
on the Health Committee.

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:42.500
And he's younger than me.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:46.040
Senpai.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:49.130
I couldn't find a blanket. Will this work?

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:50.760
I took it from the bed.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:52.510
That's bold...

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:54.430
Yeah. Thanks.

00:16:56.550 --> 00:16:57.760
Are you okay?

00:16:57.760 --> 00:16:59.350
Yeah.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.060
You have a fever.

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:05.230
I'll go find the nurse.
You should be taken home.

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.570
No, th-that's okay.

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:13.990
I feel well enough to
go home myself. I'm okay.

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:15.030
But...

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:18.070
It's just one train. It's fine.

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:21.160
I look so lame.

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:24.000
Then I'll walk you home.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:24.830
What?

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:29.460
We're on the same line,
and my pass will work for your station.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:32.210
Or at least as far as the station.

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:34.590
How come...

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:38.510
...you're willing to go
to all that trouble?

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:40.510
How come?

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:44.310
I want to take care of you, Senpai.

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:56.030
Not fair.

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:59.200
What is it? Are you okay?

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:01.370
Yeah.

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:04.080
Then go find the nurse after all.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.830
Okay. I'll be back.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:07.670
Okay. Thanks.

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:16.260
I thought I might get him
to say he likes me,

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:18.970
but I didn't expect that response.

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:23.640
What's the deal?

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:26.350
Am I only a <i>senpai </i>to him? Or...

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:31.860
Oh, man...

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:33.780
My hopes are up.

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:38.780
"Currently Out.
Will Return Soon."

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:40.160
"Currently Out.
Will Return Soon."
What is it?

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:43.490
Ogasawara sent me my festival schedule.

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:48.460
Looks like we won't both be free until
after the cross-dressing competition.

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.170
And lunch time is short.

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:54.840
Our class is doing a café,
and there are lots of shifts.

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:58.970
Do you already have
lunch plans with someone?

00:18:58.970 --> 00:19:00.340
Nope.

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:04.060
Then... would you like
to have lunch together?

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:08.140
Yeah.

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:11.100
I'll make sure I get over my cold.

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:12.770
Take it easy.

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:14.070
I will.

00:19:14.070 --> 00:19:16.480
Oh, you're back.

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.700
"Second High School
Cultural Festival"

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:25.200
"Pork Skewers"

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:28.750
"Haunted House"

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:32.080
"Fujisawa South Second High School"
"Cheesy Chicken"

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:32.080
Cul-tur-al fes-ti-val!

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:34.090
Cul-tur-al fes-ti-val!

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:40.680
The cultural festival has officially
begun! Enjoy it to the fullest!

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:43.300
Let's get the most customers!

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:46.060
Beat Class A fair and square!

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:47.180
Yeah!

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:50.600
"Escape!"

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:50.600
I'm gonna check things out. Want anything?

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:52.440
Class A's cheesy chicken!

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:55.940
After what we just said?
Tashiro, you traitor!

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:57.820
Huh? You don't want to try it?

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:58.740
I do.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:01.530
It's bound to be delicious.

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:06.450
If we contribute to Class A,
then shouldn't they contribute to us?

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:09.040
Does anyone have dirt on Class A?

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:11.500
What happened to "fair and square?"

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:13.420
I'll get enough for everyone.

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:14.960
Thanks! Supersize!

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:17.090
They don't have that.

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:19.510
Registration is over there.

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:23.720
Miyano, do you want Class A's stuff
for lunch, too. Or something else?

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:26.550
I already have lunch plans.

00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:29.270
Then tag along with me until then.

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:31.730
My girlfriend can't come,
so I'm taking pictures.

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:35.310
You've got the selfie thing down, huh?
I'll take the pictures.

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:36.520
'Preciate it.

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:43.780
It's almost lunch time.
Anywhere you wanna go?

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:44.910
Well...

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.660
"Hooligan Fortune Café"

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:50.950
Ya got guts com--

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:57.170
Sasaki-senpai, can I take a picture?

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:59.880
Yeah. Come on in.

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:01.510
How very fresh.

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:02.760
"Unmatched"

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:07.640
"Unmatched"
"Hooligan fortune café"

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:07.640
is a pretty incredible concept.

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:08.680
We have a lot of bad-boy types in our
class, so we decided to make use of it.

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:12.980
"No rampages"

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:12.980
We have a lot of bad-boy types in our
class, so we decided to make use of it.

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:14.560
"No rampages"

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:14.560
And the fortune telling?

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:15.900
That's over there.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.310
"Fortune Tent"

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:20.400
"Soothsayer Hanzawa
will reveal your fortune."

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:21.780
"Soothsayer Hanzawa
will reveal your fortune."
It's the Chairman.

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:24.490
"Soothsayer Hanzawa
will reveal your fortune."
I'm getting my fortune told.

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:26.280
Hanzawa-senpai.

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:27.870
Welcome!

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:34.870
Hey, Mya-chan, you came pretty early.
I have 30 more minutes to my shift.

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:39.630
I was curious to see the café.
Can I wait here?

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:44.130
Sure. I mean... I see...

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:49.390
We're supposed to play things up
when a customer comes.

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:52.350
I wasn't expecting you to come yet,

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.190
so you caught me off-guard.
Now I feel embarrassed.

00:21:56.190 --> 00:21:58.150
I think you look cool.

00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:00.110
You do?

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:02.320
Sasaki!

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:04.150
Up your hooligan factor!

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:05.860
And get the hell up!

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:08.030
Hirano-senpai?!

00:22:08.030 --> 00:22:10.450
Wow. He's a total hooligan.

00:22:12.490 --> 00:22:13.910
It fits him, right?

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:47.550
"Episode 10: 'Love.'"
